---
source: tests/golden.rs
---
  x unknown key property `when`
   ,-[tests/repos/broken-key/modules/core/keys/module.kdl:5:14]
 4 | 
 5 | key "cosign" when="published" {
   :              ^^^^^^^^|^^^^^^^
   :                      `-- not part of the schema
 6 |     generator "gpg"
   `----
  help: a key carries its kind, and everything else as child nodes

  x `gpg` is not a generator the tool has
   ,-[tests/repos/broken-key/modules/core/keys/module.kdl:6:5]
 5 | key "cosign" when="published" {
 6 |     generator "gpg"
   :     ^^^^|^^^^
   :         `-- not a generator
 7 |     public "etc/pki/containers/cosign.pub" format="jwk"
   `----
  help: the generators are `cosign`, `openssl` and `ssh-keygen`; a manifest
        picks one of them by name

  x `format` must be "pem" or "der"
   ,-[tests/repos/broken-key/modules/core/keys/module.kdl:7:44]
 6 |     generator "gpg"
 7 |     public "etc/pki/containers/cosign.pub" format="jwk"
   :                                            ^^^^^^|^^^^^
   :                                                  `-- not a format
 8 |     private "keys/cosign.key"
   `----

  x `profile` must be "module-signing", "pcr-signing" or "tls-ca"
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-key/modules/core/keys/module.kdl:12:25]
 11 | key "secureboot" {
 12 |     generator "openssl" profile="signing" bits=1
    :                         ^^^^^^^^|^^^^^^^^
    :                                 `-- not a profile
 13 |     public "/usr/share/secureboot/sb_cert.der" encoding="der"
    `----

  x `bits` is a number from 2048 to 16384
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-key/modules/core/keys/module.kdl:12:43]
 11 | key "secureboot" {
 12 |     generator "openssl" profile="signing" bits=1
    :                                           ^^^|^^
    :                                              `-- not a key size
 13 |     public "/usr/share/secureboot/sb_cert.der" encoding="der"
    `----

  x unknown `public` property `encoding`
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-key/modules/core/keys/module.kdl:13:48]
 12 |     generator "openssl" profile="signing" bits=1
 13 |     public "/usr/share/secureboot/sb_cert.der" encoding="der"
    :                                                ^^^^^^^|^^^^^^
    :                                                       `-- not part of the schema
 14 |     private ".hidden"
    `----
  help: `public` accepts `format`

  x unknown node `passphrase` in a key
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-key/modules/core/keys/module.kdl:15:5]
 14 |     private ".hidden"
 15 |     passphrase "hunter2"
    :     ^^^^^|^^^^
    :          `-- not part of the schema
 16 | }
    `----
  help: a key holds `generator`, `public` and `private`

  x key `secureboot` is declared twice
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-key/modules/core/keys/module.kdl:18:1]
 17 | 
 18 | key "secureboot" {
    : ^|^
    :  `-- already declared above
 19 |     generator "openssl"
    `----

  x `key` needs a kind
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-key/modules/core/keys/module.kdl:24:1]
 23 | 
 24 | key
    : ^|^
    :  `-- no kind given
    `----
  help: `key "cosign" { ... }`, the kind being what `tect create key` names

  x a `key` needs `generator`
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-key/modules/core/keys/module.kdl:24:1]
 23 | 
 24 | key
    : ^|^
    :  `-- incomplete
    `----

  x a `key` needs `public`
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-key/modules/core/keys/module.kdl:24:1]
 23 | 
 24 | key
    : ^|^
    :  `-- incomplete
    `----

  x a `key` needs `private`
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-key/modules/core/keys/module.kdl:24:1]
 23 | 
 24 | key
    : ^|^
    :  `-- incomplete
    `----

  x `etc/pki/containers/cosign.pub` is not an absolute path in the image
   ,-[tests/repos/broken-key/modules/core/keys/module.kdl:7:5]
 6 |     generator "gpg"
 7 |     public "etc/pki/containers/cosign.pub" format="jwk"
   :     ^^^|^^
   :        `-- the public half goes here
 8 |     private "keys/cosign.key"
   `----
  help: it is the path the built image ships the public half at, and the
        module's files/ overlay is what puts it there

  x `.hidden` is not a filename
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-key/modules/core/keys/module.kdl:14:5]
 13 |     public "/usr/share/secureboot/sb_cert.der" encoding="der"
 14 |     private ".hidden"
    :     ^^^|^^^
    :        `-- the private half is written here
 15 |     passphrase "hunter2"
    `----
  help: the private half is written under keys/private/ and never committed,
        so it is a plain name

  x `core/keys` has no public half for its secureboot key
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-key/modules/core/keys/module.kdl:18:1]
 17 | 
 18 | key "secureboot" {
    : ^|^
    :  `-- tests/repos/broken-key/keys/public/usr/share/secureboot/sb_cert.der is missing or empty
 19 |     generator "openssl"
    `----
  help: run `tect create key secureboot`
